### Overview

Basic usage of Owl Carousel with autoplay, looping, margins, and responsive item counts. The structure works with any kind of DOM element. These examples use `<div class="item">...</div>`, but other elements such as `span`, `a`, and `img` are also supported.

### Setup
```javascript
$('.owl-carousel').owlCarousel({
	margin:10,
	autoplay:true,
	loop:true,
	responsive:{
		0:{
			items:1
		},
		600:{
			items:3
		},
		1000:{
			items:5
		}
	}
})
```
### html
```html
